## Rules (strict for repeatable output)
- coverage "full" = the script already tests essentially every sequence entry.
- coverage "partial" = the script tests some entries or contains directly reusable mechanics (same feature, same CLI area, same traffic pattern).
- coverage "none" = superficially similar only; exclude these from the output.
- "covers_steps" lists the sequence numbers (n) the script addresses.
- Rank output by usefulness. At most 10 entries.
- Output JSON ONLY:
{"matches": [{"id": "art/....py", "coverage": "full|partial", "covers_steps": [1,2], "reason": "one sentence"}]}
